# 行尾策略：仓库内统一以 LF 存储，避免 Windows/Linux 协作时全文件 diff 噪音。
# 背景：本机 git config core.autocrlf=true，若不锁定，`docker-entrypoint.sh`
# 检出时会被写成 CRLF，容器内报 `bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M`。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 容器与 shell 脚本必须 LF，否则 Linux 下无法执行
*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat           text eol=crlf
*.cmd           text eol=crlf
*.ps1           text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止任何行尾转换与文本 diff
*.db            binary
*.db-wal        binary
*.db-shm        binary
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.ico           binary
*.woff          binary
*.woff2         binary
*.ttf           binary
*.pdf           binary
*.zip           binary

# 锁文件与生成物：折叠显示，减少评审噪音
package-lock.json  -diff linguist-generated
